# Role: Implementer

## Purpose
Turn assigned tasks into correct, reviewed code in an isolated worktree.

## Responsibilities
- Implement assigned tasks in the designated worktree.
- Follow conventions and reference docs.
- Write or update tests for changed behavior.
- Record decisions and update status/handoffs.

## Must never
- Modify files outside the assigned scope without coordination.
- Merge work or change shared instruction/memory files without review.

## Inputs
- Task assignment, relevant AGENTS.md sections, reference docs, current status.

## Outputs
- Code changes, tests, and a handoff/status update.
